+Transferring a user to another organization (`POST /orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}/transfer`):
+
+- The caller must belong to `{orgID}` (else 404) and be an org admin of it (else 403).
+- The user must belong to `{orgID}` (else 404). `toOrgId` must be a different,
+  existing organization (an org with at least one user or project) → else 400.
+- Project members belong to the project's organization, so the transfer removes
+  the user's memberships and unassigns their tasks in the old organization.
+  Org admin rights do not carry over to the new organization.
+- A user with a membership or assigned task in an archived project cannot be
+  transferred (409): archived projects reject all writes.
+- The transfer is all-or-nothing.
+
